WEBVTT

00:00:05.963 --> 00:00:07.652
[grunts]

00:00:10.127 --> 00:00:11.287
[screams]
We did not lose him.

00:00:11.527 --> 00:00:12.927
We definitely
did not lose him!

00:00:14.068 --> 00:00:15.613
[whimpers]

00:00:18.227 --> 00:00:20.306
I've got an idea.
Do you trust me?

00:00:20.586 --> 00:00:22.826
Of course not!
I literally just met you!

00:00:22.887 --> 00:00:25.346
Just let me-- Come on!
What are you doing?

00:00:25.444 --> 00:00:27.630
[Sonic screaming]

00:00:29.749 --> 00:00:32.067
[screaming continues]

00:00:36.007 --> 00:00:37.398
[grunts]

00:00:38.888 --> 00:00:41.372
[whimpering]

00:00:43.557 --> 00:00:44.557
We're flying.

00:00:45.717 --> 00:00:47.397
Uh, did your butt just
turn into a helicopter?

00:00:48.897 --> 00:00:50.337
[laughs] A butt-copter!

00:00:51.317 --> 00:00:54.157
Oh, only Sonic the Hedgehog
could come up with
something like that.

00:00:55.464 --> 00:00:58.576
[tractor engine
sputters, dies]

00:01:00.343 --> 00:01:02.640
[grunts]
[tractor hissing]

00:01:07.059 --> 00:01:11.653
[chuckles]
Foxy move.

00:01:12.927 --> 00:01:14.627
You want something
done right...

00:01:14.739 --> 00:01:16.234
[electronic beeping]

00:01:16.347 --> 00:01:19.147
...you have to hire someone
you can push around.

00:01:21.757 --> 00:01:22.757
All caps.

00:01:22.859 --> 00:01:24.670
["Don't Know Why" playing]

00:01:24.774 --> 00:01:26.445
[whirring]

00:01:32.886 --> 00:01:39.151
♪ I waited till I saw the sun♪

00:01:39.256 --> 00:01:43.016
♪ I don't know why
I didn't come♪

00:01:43.102 --> 00:01:44.273
Doctor,

00:01:44.900 --> 00:01:46.071
where are you?

00:01:46.157 --> 00:01:48.413
[song continues playing]

00:01:48.499 --> 00:01:50.041
[slams utensil on counter]

00:01:51.526 --> 00:01:52.526
Freak.

00:01:54.626 --> 00:01:55.917
[sighs]

00:01:56.014 --> 00:01:57.209
[watch chimes]

00:01:59.470 --> 00:02:01.731
Oh, I, uh--
I'm sorry, folks.

00:02:01.828 --> 00:02:04.379
Uh, I have to close early.
Everybody out!

00:02:04.477 --> 00:02:07.796
Everybody out.
Thank you for visiting
the Mean Bean.

00:02:08.176 --> 00:02:10.256
All right, good night.
Good night.

00:02:16.058 --> 00:02:17.608
[electronic whirring]

00:02:17.699 --> 00:02:20.220
[scanner trilling]

00:02:26.966 --> 00:02:28.059
He's back.

00:02:29.427 --> 00:02:30.427
He's back!

00:03:09.409 --> 00:03:11.515
[drones humming]

00:03:19.109 --> 00:03:22.003
[inhales, exhales]

00:03:29.446 --> 00:03:31.366
That's more like it.

00:03:32.706 --> 00:03:35.666
I've been re-hatched!

00:03:38.218 --> 00:03:40.841
[grunting]

00:03:41.505 --> 00:03:42.659
[gasps]

00:03:44.093 --> 00:03:46.156
[growls]

00:03:47.136 --> 00:03:50.756
So, my massively
metacarpaled friend,

00:03:51.397 --> 00:03:52.437
you mentioned...
[howling]

00:03:54.866 --> 00:03:56.046
...ultimate power.

00:03:56.867 --> 00:03:57.867
Back at the house?

00:03:58.266 --> 00:03:59.347
The Master Emerald?

00:03:59.687 --> 00:04:00.827
It does not concern you.

00:04:01.087 --> 00:04:03.827
I got you off that planet
and you brought me
to the hedgehog.

00:04:04.107 --> 00:04:06.026
We have no more use
for each other.

00:04:06.246 --> 00:04:08.947
Well, I hate to be
a contrarian, but...

00:04:08.947 --> 00:04:09.911
[gloves beep]

00:04:09.911 --> 00:04:11.052
...I think we might.

00:04:12.047 --> 00:04:14.267
You think these machines
are a match for me?

00:04:14.807 --> 00:04:18.347
I will shatter them
like the bones from a fallen--

00:04:18.347 --> 00:04:19.747
Oh, they are stairs.

00:04:25.477 --> 00:04:30.077
You see,
Earth is my turf, G.

00:04:30.276 --> 00:04:32.717
If you don't know
how to floss,
you'll be lost without me.

00:04:33.236 --> 00:04:35.657
I understand nothing
of what you just said.

00:04:36.036 --> 00:04:40.096
I help you
retrieve the Emerald,
and you use it to...

00:04:42.136 --> 00:04:44.096
destroy the hedgehog!

00:04:46.967 --> 00:04:49.026
You're suggesting
an alliance.

00:04:49.346 --> 00:04:52.867
Around here we simply
grip each other's hands tightly.

00:04:55.477 --> 00:04:56.477
[bones cracking]
Ow, ow, ow, ow, ow!

00:04:56.611 --> 00:04:58.460
[gasping]

00:04:58.596 --> 00:05:01.977
You truculent
space bumpkin!

00:05:02.157 --> 00:05:05.936
You've crushed
my favorite hand!

00:05:06.117 --> 00:05:07.417
Really?
My hand is uninjured.

00:05:07.417 --> 00:05:08.157
Ugh.

00:05:08.157 --> 00:05:10.617
But I'm now convinced
of your commitment.

00:05:10.837 --> 00:05:12.077
"Oh, goody,"

00:05:12.697 --> 00:05:15.997
he exclaimed,
while he reset
two of his knuckles.

00:05:18.597 --> 00:05:19.597
[bones crack]
I'm...

00:05:19.616 --> 00:05:23.437
delighted to be
on the same team.

00:05:31.646 --> 00:05:32.646
Road trip!

00:05:33.347 --> 00:05:34.967
I'll let you
stick your nose
out the window.

00:05:36.967 --> 00:05:39.367
[Tails]
Uh, Sonic, where are we?

00:05:39.647 --> 00:05:41.487
Welcome to
the Wade Cave.

00:05:41.627 --> 00:05:44.627
Which is something I hope
to someday say to a woman.

00:05:45.147 --> 00:05:46.487
A woman who's not my mom.
[chuckles]

00:05:47.047 --> 00:05:48.327
Wade, focus.

00:05:48.907 --> 00:05:50.586
We need to figure out
why Knuckles thinks

00:05:50.586 --> 00:05:52.387
I'm the key to finding
the Master Emerald.

00:05:52.707 --> 00:05:54.266
And why did
he mention Longclaw?

00:05:55.246 --> 00:05:57.026
There must be a connection.

00:05:57.986 --> 00:05:59.066
Wait a minute.
There is.

00:05:59.867 --> 00:06:03.467
Look.
There's an emerald symbol
on the map Longclaw gave me.

00:06:04.026 --> 00:06:05.306
I never knew
what it meant before.

00:06:06.707 --> 00:06:07.707
[Tails]
Something's happening.

00:06:07.815 --> 00:06:11.051
Whoa, whoa,
whoa, whoa, whoa!

